<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/aos/aos.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/bottstrap 5 modified/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/dashboard.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo_green.png">
    <title>Suppoert</title>
</head>

<body>



  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    
        
    

    <div class="container support">
          <!-- Success message -->
      <% if (successMessage) { %>
        <div class="alert success">
          <%= successMessage %>
        </div>
        <% } %>
        <div class=" row">
            <div style="text-align: center;" class="col-md-6 ">
  
              <img src="/images/bread.png" alt="">
            </div>
  
  
            <div style="text-align: center;" class="col-md-6 ">
              <img src="/images/burger.png" alt="">
            </div>
          </div>
        <div class="row mt-3">
            <div class="col-md-6">

                <div  class="head">
                    <h2 style="color: #333;">FAQS</h2>
                </div>

                <div  class="accordion">
                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
                            How much does it cost ?
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-content">
                            <p>The website is free to use, and Surprise Bags are sold for great prices that will
                                differ depending on their contents.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
                            Do you have a list with stores in the neighbourhood ?
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-content">
                            <p>Once you sign up,
                                you can search for participating stores near you, browse Surprise Bags, and even
                                bookmark your favourite stores!</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>


                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
                            What kind of products can I find on the app ?
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-content">
                            <p>We work with lots of different types of stores and restaurants, so you'll find
                                anything from supermarket groceries, to hotel breakfasts, to fresh pastries from
                                bakeries. <br><br>

                                Any fresh food that hasn't passed its use by date can be sold on the app.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
                            Do I need an account to use Grap The Goodies services ?
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-content">
                            <p>Yes, signing up allows you to access all features, including saving offers,
                                viewing your order history, and receiving notifications. It's quick and easy to
                                create an account on the website.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>


                    <!-- Add more accordion items as needed -->
                </div>




            </div>


            <div class="col-md-6">

                <h2>Leave a message Mr <%= profile.name %></h2>
                
                 <form action="/partner/support/" method="POST" class="comment-form">
                  <input style="display: none;" type="text" name="sender_id" value="<%= profile.id %>" >
                    <textarea name="message" placeholder="Write your message here..." required></textarea>
                    <button type="submit">Submit</button>
                </form> 

            </div>

        </div>





        <script src="/aos/aos.js"></script>
        <script src="/dashboard.js"></script>
</body>

</html>